WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
- Happy Valentine's day,
once again, everybody

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.650
but was Valentine's day a big
deal for y'all growing up?

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:06.510
And is it a big deal for y'all like now?

00:00:06.510 --> 00:00:09.060
- I mean, no, first of all,

00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:12.250
when I was growing up, I
liked the action of you know,

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:13.760
when you're a little
girl in elementary school

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:15.220
and you had to hand out all those cards,

00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:17.261
- [Kelly] Yeah.
- to different boys.

00:00:17.261 --> 00:00:20.070
That was like when I got
the party started, you know?

00:00:20.070 --> 00:00:22.405
- I, I never got that card.

00:00:22.405 --> 00:00:23.933
(laughter)

00:00:23.933 --> 00:00:26.160
- When I was a girl, like
third or fourth grade,

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:27.940
I loved that, you get all the Valentines

00:00:27.940 --> 00:00:29.560
and you give all the Valentines, you know?

00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:31.470
And then as I grew up,
I was like, this is such

00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:33.501
a stupid holiday, you know,

00:00:33.501 --> 00:00:35.820
forcing people to be romantic on days,

00:00:35.820 --> 00:00:38.640
you know, it's just too manufactured.

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:40.551
- Yeah, it's pressure.

00:00:40.551 --> 00:00:42.860
- So I appreciate people who
are single on this holiday.

00:00:42.860 --> 00:00:45.050
Like please, have as much fun as possible

00:00:45.050 --> 00:00:47.270
because it's just such a silly,

00:00:47.270 --> 00:00:48.850
I mean obviously I'm in love with you

00:00:48.850 --> 00:00:52.034
and I'm happy to, but don't-
- Hey man, it shows.

00:00:52.034 --> 00:00:54.611
(laughter)

00:00:54.611 --> 00:00:57.740
You're really selling it, honey!

00:00:57.740 --> 00:01:00.100
- But don't go overboard.

00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:01.301
- Gotta get rid of these.

00:01:01.301 --> 00:01:02.710
(laughter)

00:01:02.710 --> 00:01:04.715
- We hate flowers and cars.

00:01:04.715 --> 00:01:05.548
- I don't know what I was thinking,

00:01:05.548 --> 00:01:06.420
I bought her flowers

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:09.590
- I don't like any organized thing

00:01:09.590 --> 00:01:12.420
where people say on this
day, you must do this.

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:13.300
- It's pressure.

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:15.130
I don't like it, I love giving gifts.

00:01:15.130 --> 00:01:17.520
It stresses me out so much

00:01:17.520 --> 00:01:19.490
to have to have a planned thing.

00:01:19.490 --> 00:01:20.350
I don't know why

00:01:20.350 --> 00:01:23.070
but do you get each other
gifts or y'all not doing that?

00:01:23.070 --> 00:01:23.903
Cause here's my thing.

00:01:23.903 --> 00:01:26.080
At some point, you can buy your own,

00:01:26.080 --> 00:01:28.300
I'm always like, I can buy my own stuff.

00:01:28.300 --> 00:01:29.133
I don't need you to buy me stuff.

00:01:29.133 --> 00:01:30.670
So I'd rather have
something, I don't know.

00:01:30.670 --> 00:01:32.990
I like something made or a
card or something like that.

00:01:32.990 --> 00:01:34.947
- Yeah, I always appreciate
a card with writing.

00:01:34.947 --> 00:01:35.780
- [Kelly] Like meaningful.

00:01:35.780 --> 00:01:36.803
- Yeah. Much more than any gift.

00:01:36.803 --> 00:01:37.636
- [Kelly] Me too.

00:01:37.636 --> 00:01:39.060
- Cause you could buy your own stuff.

00:01:39.060 --> 00:01:39.893
- Exactly.

00:01:39.893 --> 00:01:41.396
And I do.

00:01:41.396 --> 00:01:42.229
- Me too!

00:01:42.229 --> 00:01:43.062
(laughter)

00:01:43.062 --> 00:01:43.895
- Yeah, and we do, and we should.

00:01:43.895 --> 00:01:46.280
And also, I think another point

00:01:46.280 --> 00:01:48.380
about 'single-dom' and
the people, you know

00:01:48.380 --> 00:01:49.520
the woman who was talking earlier

00:01:49.520 --> 00:01:51.360
in your audience about
being single, like please

00:01:51.360 --> 00:01:53.870
I can't tell single women enough
to enjoy your 'single-dom'.

00:01:53.870 --> 00:01:55.680
You are not going to be single for long.

00:01:55.680 --> 00:01:57.680
Nobody's ever single forever, you know?

00:01:57.680 --> 00:01:58.513
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:58.513 --> 00:02:00.760
- So enjoy and embrace it and
use it as that time to prepare

00:02:00.760 --> 00:02:02.051
for the guy or the girl that's coming.

00:02:02.051 --> 00:02:02.884
(audience cheers)

